# caption: Force and update a single-threaded call-by-need thunk.

REQUIRE live thunk; serialized evaluation; explicit failure policy
ENSURE cached value on success or propagated failure without a false done state
IF state is done THEN
  return cached value
END IF
IF state is busy THEN
  report circular demand
END IF
mark busy and evaluate stored expression in stored environment
IF evaluation fails THEN
  reset to pending and propagate failure
END IF
store value; mark done; release expression/environment references
return cached value

